/* Source sheet */
"Sources and Counting Rules" = "接入范围与统计口径";
"Conversations detected as running or waiting for input join Following. They stay after finishing, failing, or being interrupted until you click Accept, and come back when a new turn starts. Accepting only removes AgentDock's record; the original conversation is untouched." = "检测到正在执行或等待输入的对话会自动加入跟进列表。结束、出错或中断后仍保留，直到你点“确认验收”；再次检测到新一轮执行时重新加入。验收只移除 AgentDock 的跟踪记录，不改动原应用中的对话。";
"Only conversations recognizable in local storage are listed; this is not the set of tabs currently open. To add another Codex-compatible app, list it in ~/Library/Application Support/AgentDock/codex-apps.json." = "这里只列出本地存储中可识别的对话，与当前打开的标签页无关。要接入其他兼容 Codex 的应用，请写入 ~/Library/Application Support/AgentDock/codex-apps.json。";
"Done" = "完成";

