"Could not open %@: %@" = "打开 %1$@ 失败：%2$@";
"The app did not report a launch result. The conversation title has been copied." = "应用未返回启动结果。对话标题已复制。";
"%@. Opened the app and copied the conversation title; look for it inside the app." = "%@。已打开应用并复制对话标题，请在应用内查找。";

